#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:64
#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:65
#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:153
msgid "TIM Backup"
msgstr "TIM Backup"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:115
msgid ""
"The restore request failed. You can safely reopen this page to continue."
msgstr ""
"Die Wiederherstellungsanfrage ist fehlgeschlagen. Du kannst diese Seite "
"gefahrlos erneut öffnen, um fortzufahren."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:116
msgid "Cancel this restore and remove all prepared temporary database tables?"
msgstr ""
"Diese Wiederherstellung abbrechen und alle vorbereiteten temporären "
"Datenbanktabellen entfernen?"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:117
msgid ""
"Use the rollback to restore the database state from before the last restore?"
msgstr ""
"Mit dem Rollback den Datenbankstand vor der letzten Wiederherstellung "
"wiederherstellen?"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:118
msgid ""
"Permanently delete the rollback? Another restore can only start after it is "
"removed."
msgstr ""
"Den Rollback endgültig löschen? Eine weitere Wiederherstellung kann erst "
"nach dem Entfernen gestartet werden."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:119
msgid "Restore in progress. Do not close this page unless necessary."
msgstr ""
"Die Wiederherstellung läuft. Schließe diese Seite nur, wenn es notwendig ist."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:120
msgid "rows"
msgstr "Zeilen"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:137
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Übersicht"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:138
msgid "Backups"
msgstr "Backups"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:139
msgid "System"
msgstr "System"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:152
msgid "TIM Plugin Series"
msgstr "TIM-Plugin-Serie"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:154
msgid "Secure local backups with verification before you need them."
msgstr "Sichere lokale Backups mit Prüfung, bevor du sie benötigst."

#. translators: %s: Plugin version.
#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:160
#, php-format
msgid "Version %s"
msgstr "Version %s"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:175
msgid "TIM Backup sections"
msgstr "TIM-Backup-Bereiche"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:235
msgid "Back to backup management"
msgstr "Zurück zur Backup-Verwaltung"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:240
msgid "Guided restore"
msgstr "Geführte Wiederherstellung"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:241
msgid "Restore a database safely"
msgstr "Eine Datenbank sicher wiederherstellen"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:242
msgid ""
"TIM Backup verifies the selected archive, creates an emergency rollback, "
"prepares temporary tables, and activates them only after every row was "
"imported successfully."
msgstr ""
"TIM Backup prüft das ausgewählte Archiv, erstellt einen Notfall-Rollback, "
"bereitet temporäre Tabellen vor und aktiviert sie erst, nachdem jede Zeile "
"erfolgreich importiert wurde."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:246
msgid "Emergency protection"
msgstr "Notfallschutz"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:247
msgid "A rollback is available"
msgstr "Ein Rollback ist verfügbar"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:248
msgid ""
"A new restore cannot start until this rollback has been used or removed."
msgstr ""
"Eine neue Wiederherstellung kann erst gestartet werden, nachdem dieser "
"Rollback verwendet oder entfernt wurde."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:252
msgid "Run emergency rollback"
msgstr "Notfall-Rollback durchführen"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:255
msgid "Delete rollback and clean up"
msgstr "Rollback löschen und aufräumen"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:262
msgid "1. Select backup"
msgstr "1. Backup auswählen"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:264
msgid ""
"No normal backup is available. You can still use or remove the retained "
"rollback."
msgstr ""
"Es ist kein normales Backup verfügbar. Du kannst den aufbewahrten Rollback "
"weiterhin verwenden oder entfernen."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:266
msgid "Backup archive"
msgstr "Backup-Archiv"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:271
#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:486
#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:517
msgid "Full backup"
msgstr "Vollständiges Backup"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:271
#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:486
#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:517
msgid "Database backup"
msgstr "Datenbank-Backup"

#. translators: 1: Backup type, 2: Date, 3: Size.
#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:274
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s — %2$s — %3$s"
msgstr "%1$s — %2$s — %3$s"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:288
msgid "Current database data will be replaced."
msgstr "Aktuelle Datenbankdaten werden ersetzt."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:288
msgid ""
"Website files are not restored. An emergency rollback is created first and "
"retained for ten days after success."
msgstr ""
"Website-Dateien werden nicht wiederhergestellt. Zuerst wird ein Notfall-"
"Rollback erstellt, der nach erfolgreichem Abschluss zehn Tage aufbewahrt "
"wird."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:293
msgid "I understand and want to start the guided database restore."
msgstr ""
"Ich habe dies verstanden und möchte die geführte Datenbankwiederherstellung "
"starten."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:297
msgid "Start database restore"
msgstr "Datenbankwiederherstellung starten"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:303
msgid "2. Restore progress"
msgstr "2. Fortschritt der Wiederherstellung"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:307
#: includes/class-tim-backup-restore-job-service.php:1559
msgid "Verify backup archive"
msgstr "Backup-Archiv prüfen"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:308
#: includes/class-tim-backup-restore-job-service.php:1560
msgid "Create rollback"
msgstr "Rollback erstellen"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:309
#: includes/class-tim-backup-restore-job-service.php:1561
msgid "Prepare verified database files"
msgstr "Geprüfte Datenbankdateien vorbereiten"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:310
#: includes/class-tim-backup-restore-job-service.php:1562
msgid "Create temporary database tables"
msgstr "Temporäre Datenbanktabellen erstellen"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:311
#: includes/class-tim-backup-restore-job-service.php:1563
msgid "Restore database data"
msgstr "Datenbankdaten wiederherstellen"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:312
#: includes/class-tim-backup-restore-job-service.php:1564
msgid "Activate restored database atomically"
msgstr "Wiederhergestellte Datenbank atomar aktivieren"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:313
#: includes/class-tim-backup-restore-job-service.php:1565
msgid "Clean up and refresh WordPress"
msgstr "Aufräumen und WordPress aktualisieren"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:314
#: includes/class-tim-backup-restore-job-service.php:1566
msgid "Restore complete"
msgstr "Wiederherstellung abgeschlossen"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:325
msgid "Select a backup to begin."
msgstr "Wähle ein Backup aus, um zu beginnen."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:328
msgid "Retry final cleanup"
msgstr "Abschließendes Aufräumen wiederholen"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:331
msgid "Cancel restore"
msgstr "Wiederherstellung abbrechen"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:358
msgid "Backup status"
msgstr "Backup-Status"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:360
msgid "Protected locally"
msgstr "Lokal geschützt"

#. translators: %s: Human-readable backup date.
#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:365
#, php-format
msgid "Latest verified backup: %s"
msgstr "Letztes geprüftes Backup: %s"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:371
msgid "Create your first backup"
msgstr "Erstelle dein erstes Backup"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:372
msgid "No managed backup is available yet."
msgstr "Es ist noch kein verwaltetes Backup verfügbar."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:375
msgid "Manage backups"
msgstr "Backups verwalten"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:380
msgid "Weekly automation"
msgstr "Wöchentliche Automatisierung"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:381
msgid "Full site backup"
msgstr "Vollständiges Website-Backup"

#. translators: %s: Date of next scheduled backup.
#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:387
#, php-format
msgid "Next run: %s"
msgstr "Nächste Ausführung: %s"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:391
msgid "The weekly event is not currently scheduled."
msgstr "Das wöchentliche Ereignis ist derzeit nicht geplant."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:395
msgid "WordPress Cron runs when the site receives traffic."
msgstr "WordPress Cron wird ausgeführt, wenn die Website Zugriffe erhält."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:399
msgid "Local retention"
msgstr "Lokale Aufbewahrung"

#. translators: 1: Current backup count, 2: Maximum backup count.
#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:404
#, php-format
msgid "%1$d of %2$d backups"
msgstr "%1$d von %2$d Backups"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:410
msgid ""
"After a successful fourth backup, the oldest managed archive is removed."
msgstr ""
"Nach einem erfolgreichen vierten Backup wird das älteste verwaltete Archiv "
"entfernt."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:415
msgid "Security by default"
msgstr "Sicherheit als Standard"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:417
msgid "Archives use random names and protected local storage."
msgstr ""
"Archive verwenden zufällige Namen und einen geschützten lokalen Speicher."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:418
msgid "Every payload file is checked with SHA-256."
msgstr "Jede Nutzdatendatei wird mit SHA-256 geprüft."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:419
msgid "A site-bound signature is verified before restore."
msgstr ""
"Vor der Wiederherstellung wird eine an die Website gebundene Signatur "
"geprüft."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:420
msgid ""
"Downloads and changes require administrator permission and request "
"verification."
msgstr ""
"Downloads und Änderungen erfordern Administratorrechte und eine "
"Anfrageprüfung."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:449
msgid "Protected archives"
msgstr "Geschützte Archive"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:450
msgid "Local backups"
msgstr "Lokale Backups"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:453
msgid "Maximum: 3"
msgstr "Maximum: 3"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:454
msgid "Open restore assistant"
msgstr "Wiederherstellungsassistent öffnen"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:461
msgid "No backups yet"
msgstr "Noch keine Backups"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:462
msgid "Create a full or database backup above."
msgstr "Erstelle oben ein vollständiges oder ein Datenbank-Backup."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:491
msgid "Back up the database and regular files below the WordPress root."
msgstr ""
"Sichert die Datenbank und reguläre Dateien unterhalb des WordPress-"
"Stammverzeichnisses."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:492
msgid ""
"Back up all current-site database tables, including WooCommerce HPOS tables."
msgstr ""
"Sichert alle Datenbanktabellen der aktuellen Website einschließlich "
"WooCommerce-HPOS-Tabellen."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:501
msgid "Create and verify"
msgstr "Erstellen und prüfen"

#. translators: %s: Backup duration in seconds.
#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:540
#, php-format
msgid "%s seconds"
msgstr "%s Sekunden"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:550
msgid "Verified at creation"
msgstr "Bei Erstellung geprüft"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:551
msgid "Archive changed"
msgstr "Archiv verändert"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:562
msgid "Download"
msgstr "Herunterladen"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:566
msgid "Restore database only"
msgstr "Nur Datenbank wiederherstellen"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:566
msgid "Restore database"
msgstr "Datenbank wiederherstellen"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:570
msgid "Delete"
msgstr "Löschen"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:575
msgid "Permanently delete this backup?"
msgstr "Dieses Backup dauerhaft löschen?"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:578
msgid "I understand that this archive cannot be recovered."
msgstr ""
"Ich habe verstanden, dass dieses Archiv nicht wiederhergestellt werden kann."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:580
msgid "Delete permanently"
msgstr "Dauerhaft löschen"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:596
msgid "PHP 8.1 or newer"
msgstr "PHP 8.1 oder neuer"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:597
msgid "PHP ZIP extension"
msgstr "PHP-ZIP-Erweiterung"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:598
msgid "Writable backup storage"
msgstr "Beschreibbarer Backup-Speicher"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:599
msgid "Single-site WordPress"
msgstr "WordPress-Einzelinstallation"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:604
msgid "Environment"
msgstr "Umgebung"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:605
msgid "System checks"
msgstr "Systemprüfungen"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:611
msgid "Ready"
msgstr "Bereit"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:611
msgid "Action needed"
msgstr "Handlung erforderlich"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:618
msgid "Privacy"
msgstr "Datenschutz"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:619
msgid "Local by design"
msgstr "Bewusst lokal"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:620
msgid ""
"TIM Backup Free does not create an account, track usage, or contact an "
"external service."
msgstr ""
"TIM Backup Free erstellt kein Konto, erfasst keine Nutzung und kontaktiert "
"keinen externen Dienst."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:621
msgid ""
"Backup archives remain on this WordPress server until an administrator "
"downloads or deletes them."
msgstr ""
"Backup-Archive bleiben auf diesem WordPress-Server, bis ein Administrator "
"sie herunterlädt oder löscht."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:59
msgid "The requested backup type is invalid."
msgstr "Der angeforderte Backup-Typ ist ungültig."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:66
#: includes/class-tim-backup-storage.php:259
msgid "The requested archive purpose is invalid."
msgstr "Der angeforderte Archivzweck ist ungültig."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:73
msgid "The PHP ZIP extension is required to create backups."
msgstr "Die PHP-ZIP-Erweiterung wird zum Erstellen von Backups benötigt."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:118
#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:175
msgid "The completed backup archive could not be hashed."
msgstr "Für das fertige Backup-Archiv konnte kein Hash erstellt werden."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:153
msgid "The completed backup archive could not be finalized."
msgstr "Das abgeschlossene Backup-Archiv konnte nicht finalisiert werden."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:215
msgid "The backup archive does not exist."
msgstr "Das Backup-Archiv existiert nicht."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:224
msgid "The backup archive is not a readable ZIP file."
msgstr "Das Backup-Archiv ist keine lesbare ZIP-Datei."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:234
msgid "The backup manifest is missing."
msgstr "Das Backup-Manifest fehlt."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:249
msgid "The backup manifest is invalid or unsupported."
msgstr "Das Backup-Manifest ist ungültig oder wird nicht unterstützt."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:261
msgid "The backup signature is invalid. The archive may have been changed."
msgstr ""
"Die Backup-Signatur ist ungültig. Das Archiv wurde möglicherweise verändert."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:269
msgid "This backup belongs to a different WordPress site."
msgstr "Dieses Backup gehört zu einer anderen WordPress-Website."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:297
msgid "The backup contains an unexpected, duplicate, or unsafe archive entry."
msgstr ""
"Das Backup enthält einen unerwarteten, doppelten oder unsicheren "
"Archiveintrag."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:308
msgid "The backup archive contents do not match its signed manifest."
msgstr ""
"Der Inhalt des Backup-Archivs stimmt nicht mit seinem signierten Manifest "
"überein."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:317
msgid "The backup contains an unsafe archive path."
msgstr "Das Backup enthält einen unsicheren Archivpfad."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:327
msgid "A file recorded by the backup manifest is missing."
msgstr "Eine im Backup-Manifest verzeichnete Datei fehlt."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:339
#: includes/class-tim-backup-restore-job-service.php:828
msgid "A backup file failed its integrity check."
msgstr "Eine Backup-Datei hat die Integritätsprüfung nicht bestanden."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:363
msgid "TIM Backup could not create a temporary working directory."
msgstr "TIM Backup konnte kein temporäres Arbeitsverzeichnis erstellen."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:372
msgid "TIM Backup could not create the backup archive."
msgstr "TIM Backup konnte das Backup-Archiv nicht erstellen."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:410
msgid "TIM Backup could not write the archive manifest."
msgstr "TIM Backup konnte das Archiv-Manifest nicht schreiben."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:417
msgid "TIM Backup could not finish writing the backup archive."
msgstr "TIM Backup konnte das Schreiben des Backup-Archivs nicht abschließen."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:443
msgid "The database could not start a repeatable-read backup transaction."
msgstr "Die Datenbank konnte keine Repeatable-Read-Backup-Transaktion starten."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:453
msgid "The database could not start a consistent backup transaction."
msgstr "Die Datenbank konnte keine konsistente Backup-Transaktion starten."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:472
msgid "No WordPress database tables were found."
msgstr "Es wurden keine WordPress-Datenbanktabellen gefunden."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:486
msgid "A database table has an unsafe name and cannot be backed up."
msgstr ""
"Eine Datenbanktabelle hat einen unsicheren Namen und kann nicht gesichert "
"werden."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:497
msgid "A database table schema could not be exported."
msgstr "Ein Datenbanktabellenschema konnte nicht exportiert werden."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:506
msgid ""
"A prefixed database object is not a base table and cannot be backed up by "
"this version."
msgstr ""
"Ein Datenbankobjekt mit Präfix ist keine Basistabelle und kann mit dieser "
"Version nicht gesichert werden."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:521
msgid "All backed-up tables must use InnoDB for a consistent snapshot."
msgstr ""
"Alle gesicherten Tabellen müssen für einen konsistenten Snapshot InnoDB "
"verwenden."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:535
msgid "Every backed-up table must have a primary key for deterministic export."
msgstr ""
"Jede gesicherte Tabelle benötigt für einen deterministischen Export einen "
"Primärschlüssel."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:556
msgid "A primary-key column has an unsafe name."
msgstr "Eine Primärschlüsselspalte hat einen unsicheren Namen."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:580
#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:641
msgid "A temporary database export file could not be created."
msgstr "Eine temporäre Datenbankexportdatei konnte nicht erstellt werden."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:600
msgid "Database rows could not be exported."
msgstr "Datenbankzeilen konnten nicht exportiert werden."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:619
msgid "A database row is too large for the resumable backup format."
msgstr "Eine Datenbankzeile ist für das fortsetzbare Backup-Format zu groß."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:654
msgid "Database export data could not be written."
msgstr "Datenbankexportdaten konnten nicht geschrieben werden."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:681
msgid "The database schema is too large for the resumable backup format."
msgstr "Das Datenbankschema ist für das fortsetzbare Backup-Format zu groß."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:690
msgid "The database schema could not be added to the archive."
msgstr "Das Datenbankschema konnte dem Archiv nicht hinzugefügt werden."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:701
msgid "The consistent database snapshot could not be completed."
msgstr "Der konsistente Datenbank-Snapshot konnte nicht abgeschlossen werden."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:731
msgid "Database export data could not be added to the archive."
msgstr "Datenbankexportdaten konnten dem Archiv nicht hinzugefügt werden."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:740
msgid "Database export data could not be hashed."
msgstr "Für Datenbankexportdaten konnte kein Hash erstellt werden."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:763
msgid "The WordPress or backup storage path could not be resolved."
msgstr "Der WordPress- oder Backup-Speicherpfad konnte nicht aufgelöst werden."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:801
msgid "A WordPress file could not be added to the backup archive."
msgstr ""
"Eine WordPress-Datei konnte dem Backup-Archiv nicht hinzugefügt werden."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:810
msgid "A WordPress file could not be hashed."
msgstr "Für eine WordPress-Datei konnte kein Hash erstellt werden."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-backup-service.php:819
msgid "A WordPress directory could not be read during backup."
msgstr ""
"Ein WordPress-Verzeichnis konnte während des Backups nicht gelesen werden."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-plugin.php:216
msgid "TIM Backup activation failed"
msgstr "Aktivierung von TIM Backup fehlgeschlagen"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-plugin.php:255
msgid "The backup was created and verified successfully."
msgstr "Das Backup wurde erfolgreich erstellt und geprüft."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-plugin.php:273
msgid "The deletion was not confirmed."
msgstr "Das Löschen wurde nicht bestätigt."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-plugin.php:295
msgid "The backup was deleted."
msgstr "Das Backup wurde gelöscht."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-plugin.php:422
msgid "The requested backup could not be downloaded."
msgstr "Das angeforderte Backup konnte nicht heruntergeladen werden."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-plugin.php:492
msgid ""
"Maintenance work is in progress. The website will be available again shortly."
msgstr ""
"Wartungsarbeiten werden durchgeführt. Die Website ist in Kürze wieder "
"verfügbar."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-plugin.php:493
msgid "Maintenance mode"
msgstr "Wartungsmodus"

#. translators: %s: Current plugin version.
#: includes/class-tim-backup-plugin.php:509
#, php-format
msgid "TIM Backup Free %s does not support WordPress Multisite."
msgstr "TIM Backup Free %s unterstützt WordPress Multisite nicht."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-plugin.php:518
msgid ""
"A database restore is in progress. Other backup changes are temporarily "
"unavailable."
msgstr ""
"Eine Datenbankwiederherstellung läuft. Andere Backup-Änderungen sind "
"vorübergehend nicht verfügbar."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-plugin.php:533
msgid "You are not allowed to restore backups."
msgstr "Du bist nicht berechtigt, Backups wiederherzustellen."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-plugin.php:567
msgid "You are not allowed to manage backups."
